      "title": "MCP · Tool Operations",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Meaning: completed MCP tool calls per second in the current rate interval. 0.00 is normal when no MCP tool completed recently; use a wider time range and Rate by Tool and Outcome to confirm historical traffic. A high rate is load, not a failure by itself.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "fixedColor": "blue",
            "mode": "fixed"
          },
          "decimals": 2,
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(notegate_mcp_tool_calls_total{job=\"notegate\", instance=~\"$instance\", tool=~\"$tool\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "calls",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "MCP Tool Rate",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Meaning: share of dispatched MCP tools returning an MCP error; authentication failures before tool dispatch are counted in HTTP RED instead. Sustained non-zero values indicate tool, input, permission, or internal failures. Check Rate by Tool and Outcome to identify the tool, then application logs.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 2,
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(notegate_mcp_tool_calls_total{job=\"notegate\", instance=~\"$instance\", tool=~\"$tool\", outcome=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(notegate_mcp_tool_calls_total{job=\"notegate\", instance=~\"$instance\", tool=~\"$tool\"}[$__rate_interval])), 1e-9) or vector(0)",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "errors",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "MCP Error Rate",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Meaning: 95% of completed MCP tool calls are faster than this value. A sustained rise relative to baseline indicates a slow tool path. Check p95 Latency by Tool first, then correlate Search Detail, DB Acquire p95, and decryption p95.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 3,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "color": "gray",
                  "text": "No calls"
                }
              },
              "type": "special"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.25
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(notegate_mcp_tool_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"notegate\", instance=~\"$instance\", tool=~\"$tool\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "MCP p95 Latency",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Use this to identify which bounded MCP tool contributes load or errors. A single tool's error series rising points to that tool contract or backend path; broad errors across tools point to shared auth-after-dispatch, DB, or service dependencies. Confirm with logs.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (tool, outcome) (rate(notegate_mcp_tool_calls_total{job=\"notegate\", instance=~\"$instance\", tool=~\"$tool\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}} · {{outcome}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Rate by Tool and Outcome",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Use this after aggregate MCP p95 rises. Search-only latency points to Search Detail; read/write/manage latency with DB acquire growth points to database contention; one isolated tool points to its own handler path.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, tool) (rate(notegate_mcp_tool_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"notegate\", instance=~\"$instance\", tool=~\"$tool\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "p95 Latency by Tool",
