        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Compare p50, p95, and p99 acquisition latency. A widening tail with stable p50 indicates intermittent contention or slow connection validation; all percentiles rising indicates broad DB/network pressure. Correlate with utilization and timeouts.",
